 query: 'Bull World Health Org||84|485||bib21|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Luscombe</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Fryer</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name><name><surname>French</surname><given-names>ME</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Saxby</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>PW</given-names></name><name><surname>Strange</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Exposure to ultraviolet radiation: Association with susceptibility and age at presentation with prostate cancer</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2001</year><volume>358</volume><fpage>641</fpage><lpage>642</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Lancet||358|641||bib22|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11530156</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib23"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Office for National Statistics</collab></person-group><article-title/><source>Registrations of cancer diagnosed in 1993&#x02013;1996, England and Wales. Health Statistics Quarterly</source><year>2005</year><publisher-name>London: HMSO</publisher-name><fpage>59</fpage><lpage>70</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Oh</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Hennessy</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ha</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Bisset</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Diffey</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Rees</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The time-course of photoadaption and pigmentation studied using a novel method to distinguish pigmen